# AgroQ Engineering Rules

- Read `AGENTS.md` before editing.
- Preserve manual workflows when adding automation.
- Keep core operation independent of internet, cloud AI, and quantum services.
- Every generated recommendation requires provenance and an approval state.
- Never add direct autonomous control for irrigation, biological treatment, organism release, or moving equipment.
- Use adapters for external systems.
- Add tests for database and approval behavior.
- Do not overwrite raw observations.
- Label compute type truthfully.
- Update relevant documentation with architectural changes.
